    "findings": [
      "Both pinned and current sources lack effort lists for all three requested Realtime models.",
      "Pinned provider filters temperature using static metadata before original-option validation.",
      "Current GPT-6 provider retains sampling for effort-aware validation; strict rejection is intentional.",
      "Generation, stream, batch and Responses WebSocket use the validator; native input counting projects fields without it.",
      "Generic STT streaming does not encode conversation-model/session-mode/transport support.",
      "Shared exports contain vendor IDs but no LLM display-name/color catalog."
    ]
  },
